(Developer notes)

Docker images (see README for details):
>docker build --build-context galileo=../galileo -t cascala/igalileo:0.1.4 -t cascala/igalileo:latest .
>docker push cascala/igalileo:0.1.4 && docker push cascala/igalileo:latest

Multi-architecture (Intel and Apple Silicon) in one go:
>docker buildx build --platform linux/amd64,linux/arm64 --build-context galileo=../galileo \
   -t cascala/igalileo:0.1.4 -t cascala/igalileo:latest --push .
